Found it. The root cause is in `lib/src/cli/agent_cli_config.dart:963-973`:

```dart
  /// explicit `agent.stuckTool:` wins everywhere; otherwise headless runs
  /// ...
  StuckToolConfig effectiveStuckTool() {
    final configured = stuckTool;
    ...
        ? const StuckToolConfig()
        : const StuckToolConfig(followUp: StuckFollowUpMode.advisory);
```

So interactive REPL/TUI sessions default to advisory when there's no explicit `agent.stuckTool:` config — which violates invariant I1 ("escalation is unconditional... `advisory` exists only as an explicit opt-out, never as an implicit default for interactive sessions"). The incident was an interactive session, hence advisory-only: stuck flag fired, no cancel/retry/convert, call hung 27 min.

